      "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Dehumanization",
      "description": "The meme uses the phrase 'kinda looks like a mountain panda' to dehumanize the suspect by reducing him to an animal, which is a common tactic in anti-Black racism to strip Black individuals of their humanity and dignity. This dehumanizing trope is not visible in the image but is necessary to interpret the meme’s harmful message.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
