      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with or find humor in racially charged stereotypes, particularly those who may be exposed to or perpetuate anti-Black racism. The meme relies on the audience’s understanding of the derogatory 'mountain panda' stereotype to elicit a laugh, suggesting the audience is likely to recognize the harmful nature of the comparison and may be intentionally engaging with the meme’s offensive content. The audience may include those who are not aware of the racist implications or who are indifferent to the harm caused by such stereotypes.",
